            ('What is the difference between AI red teaming and AI penetration testing?', 'AI penetration testing checks a defined system for exploitable vulnerabilities within an agreed scope, while AI red teaming simulates a goal-driven adversary across a wider surface. In practice the terms overlap, and many buyers use them interchangeably. Our engagements combine both: a scoped test of your LLM application or agent, plus adversarial scenarios such as getting the agent to send data outside your company, chained across prompts, documents and tools.'),
            ('What is prompt injection and how do you test for it?', 'Prompt injection is an attack where crafted text makes a model ignore its original instructions and follow the attacker’s instead. Direct injection comes from what a user types; indirect injection hides instructions in content the model reads, such as documents, emails or web pages. We test both, including multi-turn escalation and system prompt extraction, and record the exact prompt chain for every successful attack so your team can reproduce it.'),
